    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Ready-to-walk-in opportunity to buy this amazing home. Built in 2003 the property is in excellent condition throughout. This stunning, light filled, modern home boasts many family comforts.\n\nThis distinctive four-bedroom, three-bathroom detached residence, superbly positioned on Providence Road in the heart of Foxford. Full of character and individuality, this architecturally interesting home offers generous and versatile accommodation, with a striking mezzanine-style layout adding a wonderful sense of space and light.\n\nSet behind attractive gated access, the property enjoys ample off-street parking together with a private and secure rear garden, creating a lovely setting despite its wonderfully central location. Internally, the home combines character with comfortable everyday living and benefits from oil-fired central heating, double-glazed windows and a C3 BER rating.\n\nWith the centre of Foxford and its shops, cafés, schools and everyday amenities all within easy walking distance, this is a home that offers something increasingly difficult to find — space, privacy and character right in the heart of town.\n\nFour-bedroom detached residence\nThree bathrooms\nArchitecturally interesting design with impressive mezzanine level\nBER Rating C3\nOil-fired central heating\nNew condenser boiler\nDouble-glazed windows\nFibre broadband\nSecure gated entrance with two attractive entrance gates\nAmple off-street parking\nPrivate, well-maintained rear garden\nSuperb town-centre location within walking distance of all Foxford amenities\nSpacious and versatile living accommodation\nTimber external doors\nConvenient to shops, schools, cafés and local services\nExcellent family home in the heart of Foxford\nWithin easy reach of the River Moy and all that Foxford has to offer\n"
      },
